cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cMeta AOps in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "cMeta AOps (cmeta-aops)"
abstract: >-
  cmeta-aops is an experimental plugin repository and prototyping playground of
  reusable cMeta artifacts for AI Operations: portable, composable recipes that
  install and run tools, build and benchmark programs, and fetch models and
  datasets across operating systems and hardware targets through a single uniform
  interface. It supports open science, collaborative research, experimentation and
  portable AI-agent workflows, encoding accumulated R&D practice as executable,
  machine-readable automations that humans and AI agents can discover, compose and
  extend. Components are exploratory and vary in maturity.
